br><br>\u30fb In battle scenes, an unusual system that specifies the shape and range of attacks according to the placement of enemies.<br>\u3000You can think about it carefully, or you don't have to think about it. It can be enjoyed by beginners and gamers alike!<br><br>\u30fbIt takes about 5~6 hours to clear. There is no scenario branching, so you can play easily and quickly.<br>\u3000Please enjoy this work with a lot of fun and excitement.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477130/extras/kuroba.PNG?t=1709354950\" /></span><strong>Other</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477130/extras/kuroba.PNG?t=1709354950\" /></span><br><br>\u30fb There are some slightly shocking scenes! <br>(Contains horror elements, anxiety expressions, mild gore expressions, expressions related to suicide, expressions reminiscent of war, and scenes in which weapons are used)<br><br>\u30fb Permission is not required for the act of earning money through play video distribution, etc. Please feel free to do so.<br><br>\u30fbAll can be played for free. There are no plans to add paid content.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477130/extras/a7f83a3c4ac7106d5a9fc8f2403fbbd2.poster.avif?t=1709354950\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477130/extras/a7f83a3c4ac7106d5a9fc8f2403fbbd2.webp?t=1709354950\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477130/extras/05e437be85ddd23b4b52f0ebb62a0bbc.poster.avif?t=1709354950\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass